--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- PROJECT: SPI MASTER AND SLAVE FOR FPGA
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- AUTHORS: Jakub Cabal <jakubcabal@gmail.com>
-- LICENSE: The MIT License, please read LICENSE file
-- WEBSITE: https://github.com/jakubcabal/spi-fpga
